          "solution": "រូបមន្តមុំក្រៅ $\\beta = \\dfrac{360^\\circ}{n}$ និងមុំក្នុង $\\alpha = 180^\\circ - \\beta$ ៖\n\n \n• ក) បញ្ចកោណ ($n=5$) ៖ $\\beta = \\dfrac{360^\\circ}{5} = 72^\\circ$, $\\alpha = 180^\\circ - 72^\\circ = 108^\\circ$\n \n• ខ) ឆកោណ ($n=6$) ៖ $\\beta = \\dfrac{360^\\circ}{6} = 60^\\circ$, $\\alpha = 180^\\circ - 60^\\circ = 120^\\circ$\n \n• គ) អដ្ឋកោណ ($n=8$) ៖ $\\beta = \\dfrac{360^\\circ}{8} = 45^\\circ$, $\\alpha = 180^\\circ - 45^\\circ = 135^\\circ$\n \n• ឃ) ទសកោណ ($n=10$) ៖ $\\beta = \\dfrac{360^\\circ}{10} = 36^\\circ$, $\\alpha = 180^\\circ - 36^\\circ = 144^\\circ$"
