          "solution": "ដោះស្រាយដោយវិធីបំបពេញជាការ៉េពេញលេញ ៖\n**(ក)**  $x^2 + 4x - 5 = 0 \\iff x^2 + 2(2)x + 2^2 = 5 + 4$\n$\\iff (x + 2)^2 = 9 \\implies x + 2 = \\pm 3$\n$\\implies x = -2 + 3 = \\mathbf{1} \\lor x = -2 - 3 = \\mathbf{-5}$។\n**(ខ)**  $x^2 - 6x + 5 = 0 \\iff x^2 - 2(3)x + 3^2 = -5 + 9$\n$\\iff (x - 3)^2 = 4 \\implies x - 3 = \\pm 2$\n$\\implies \\mathbf{x = 5 \\lor x = 1}$។\n**(គ)**  $x^2 - 2x - 8 = 0 \\iff (x - 1)^2 - 1 - 8 = 0$\n$\\iff (x - 1)^2 = 9 \\implies x - 1 = \\pm 3 \\implies \\mathbf{x = 4 \\lor x = -2}$។\n**(ឃ)**  $x^2 + 10x + 9 = 0 \\iff (x + 5)^2 - 25 + 9 = 0$\n$\\iff (x + 5)^2 = 16 \\implies x + 5 = \\pm 4 \\implies \\mathbf{x = -1 \\lor x = -9}$។"
