          "type": "written",
          "points": 5,
          "question": "តើ $\\cos 60^\\circ$ មានតម្លៃស្មើនឹងប៉ុន្មាន?\n\n • $\\frac{1}{2}$\n\n • $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$\n\n • $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$\n\n • $1$",
          "solution": "កំណត់តម្លៃផលធៀបត្រីកោណមាត្រ៖\n\n \n• **រូបទី 1៖** $\\triangle ABC$ កែងត្រង់ $C$ មានជ្រុងកែង $AC = 12$, $BC = 5$។\nតាមទ្រឹស្ដីបទពីតាករ អ៊ីប៉ូតេនុសគឺ៖\n \\[ AB = \\sqrt{AC^2 + BC^2} = \\sqrt{12^2 + 5^2} = \\sqrt{169} = 13 \\]\n ចំពោះមុំស្រួច $A$៖\n \\begin{align*}\n**(ក)** \\ \\sin A &= \\frac{\\text{ឈម}}{\\text{អ៊ីប៉ូតេនុស}} = \\frac{BC}{AB} = \\frac{5}{13} \\\\\n**(ខ)** \\ \\cos A &= \\frac{\\text{ជាប់}}{\\text{អ៊ីប៉ូតេនុស}} = \\frac{AC}{AB} = \\frac{12}{13} \\\\\n**(គ)** \\ \\tan A &= \\frac{\\text{ឈម}}{\\text{ជាប់}} = \\frac{BC}{AC} = \\frac{5}{12}\n\\end{align*}\n ចំពោះមុំស្រួច $B$៖\n \\begin{align*}\n**(ឃ)** \\ \\sin B &= \\frac{AC}{AB} = \\frac{12}{13} \\\\\n**(ង)** \\ \\cos B &= \\frac{BC}{AB} = \\frac{5}{13} \\\\\n**(ច)** \\ \\tan B &= \\frac{AC}{BC} = \\frac{12}{5}\n\\end{align*}\n \n• **រូបទី 2៖** $\\triangle ABC$ កែងត្រង់ $A$ មាន $AC = 7$, $AB = 24$, អ៊ីប៉ូតេនុស $BC = 25$។\n \\begin{align*}\n**(ឃ)** \\ \\sin B &= \\frac{\\text{ឈម}}{\\text{អ៊ីប៉ូតេនុស}} = \\frac{AC}{BC} = \\frac{7}{25} \\\\\n**(ង)** \\ \\cos B &= \\frac{\\text{ជាប់}}{\\text{អ៊ីប៉ូតេនុស}} = \\frac{AB}{BC} = \\frac{24}{25} \\\\\n**(ច)** \\ \\tan B &= \\frac{\\text{ឈម}}{\\text{ជាប់}} = \\frac{AC}{AB} = \\frac{7}{24}\n\\end{align*}"
