          "solution": "រកតម្លៃផលធៀបត្រីកោណមាត្រ៖\n\n \n• $\\sin\\alpha = \\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ និង $0^\\circ \\le \\alpha \\le 180^\\circ$៖\n$\\cos^2\\alpha = 1 - \\sin^2\\alpha = 1 - \\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{1}{4} \\implies \\cos\\alpha = \\pm\\frac{1}{2}$\n\n \n• បើ $\\alpha = 60^\\circ$ (មុំស្រួច)៖ $\\cos\\alpha = \\frac{1}{2}, \\ \\tan\\alpha = \\sqrt{3}$\n \n• បើ $\\alpha = 120^\\circ$ (មុំទាល)៖ $\\cos\\alpha = -\\frac{1}{2}, \\ \\tan\\alpha = -\\sqrt{3}$\n\n \n• $\\cos\\alpha = -\\dfrac{4}{5}$ និង $90^\\circ \\le \\alpha \\le 180^\\circ$ (កាដ្រង់ទី ២)៖\nក្នុងកាដ្រង់ទី ២ ស៊ីនុសវិជ្ជមាន៖\n \\[ \\sin\\alpha = \\sqrt{1 - \\cos^2\\alpha} = \\sqrt{1 - \\frac{16}{25}} = \\frac{3}{5} \\]\n \\[ \\tan\\alpha = \\frac{\\sin\\alpha}{\\cos\\alpha} = \\frac{3/5}{-4/5} = -\\frac{3}{4} \\]\n \n• $\\tan\\alpha = 2$ និង $0^\\circ \\le \\alpha \\le 90^\\circ$ (កាដ្រង់ទី ១)៖\n$1 + \\tan^2\\alpha = \\dfrac{1}{\\cos^2\\alpha} \\implies \\cos^2\\alpha = \\dfrac{1}{1 + 4} = \\dfrac{1}{5} \\implies \\cos\\alpha = \\dfrac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$\n \\[ \\sin\\alpha = \\tan\\alpha \\cdot \\cos\\alpha = 2 \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5} = \\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5} \\]\n \n• $\\tan\\alpha = -\\dfrac{1}{2}$ និង $90^\\circ \\le \\alpha \\le 180^\\circ$ (កាដ្រង់ទី ២)៖\nក្នុងកាដ្រង់ទី ២ កូស៊ីនុសអវិជ្ជមាន៖\n \\begin{align*}\n\\cos\\alpha &= -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 + \\tan^2\\alpha}} = -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 + 1/4}} \\\\\n&= -\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} = -\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5} \\\\\n\\sin\\alpha &= \\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\left(-\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}\\right) = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}\n\\end{align*}"
