          "category": "ធរណីមាត្រ-វ៉ិចទ័រ",
          "type": "written",
          "points": 5,
          "question": "កូអរដោនេនៃវ៉ិចទ័រ $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ ដែល $A(2, -2)$ និង $B(1, 3)$ គឺ៖\n\n • $(3, 1)$\n\n • $(1, 5)$\n\n • $(1, -5)$\n\n • $(-1, 5)$",
          "solution": "គេឱ្យ $A(-2, 2)$, $B(-1, 5)$ និង $C(5, 3)$។\n\n**(ក)**  **បង្ហាញថា $\\triangle ABC$ កែងត្រង់ $B$៖**\nគណនាកូអរដោនេនៃវ៉ិចទ័រ $\\overrightarrow{BA}$ និង $\\overrightarrow{BC}$៖\n\\begin{align*}\n\\overrightarrow{BA} &= (-2 - (-1), 2 - 5) = (-1, -3) \\\\\n\\overrightarrow{BC} &= (5 - (-1), 3 - 5) = (6, -2)\n\\end{align*}\nគណនាផលគុណស្កាលែរ $\\overrightarrow{BA} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{BC}$៖\n\\[ \\overrightarrow{BA} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{BC} = (-1)(6) + (-3)(-2) = -6 + 6 = 0 \\]\nដោយ $\\overrightarrow{BA} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{BC} = 0$ នាំឱ្យ $\\overrightarrow{BA} \\perp \\overrightarrow{BC}$។ ដូចនេះ $\\triangle ABC$ ជាត្រីកោណកែងត្រង់ $B$។\n\n**(ខ)**  **គណនាកូស៊ីនុសនៃ $\\angle BAC$៖**\nក្នុងត្រីកោណកែង $ABC$ ត្រង់ $B$ គេបាន $\\cos(\\angle BAC) = \\dfrac{AB}{AC}$។\n\n \n• $AB = \\|\\overrightarrow{BA}\\| = \\sqrt{(-1)^2 + (-3)^2} = \\sqrt{1 + 9} = \\sqrt{10}$\n \n• $BC = \\|\\overrightarrow{BC}\\| = \\sqrt{6^2 + (-2)^2} = \\sqrt{36 + 4} = \\sqrt{40} = 2\\sqrt{10}$\n \n• $AC = \\sqrt{AB^2 + BC^2} = \\sqrt{10 + 40} = \\sqrt{50} = 5\\sqrt{2}$\n\n\\begin{align*}\n\\cos(\\angle BAC) &= \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{5\\sqrt{2}} = \\frac{\\sqrt{5 \\times 2}}{5\\sqrt{2}} \\\\\n&= \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}\n\\end{align*}\n**(គ)**  **គណនាផ្ទៃក្រឡានៃ $\\triangle ABC$៖**\n\\begin{align*}\nS &= \\frac{1}{2} AB \\times BC \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{2} \\times \\sqrt{10} \\times 2\\sqrt{10} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 20 = 10\\text{ (ឯកតាផ្ទៃ)}\n\\end{align*}"
